Acceptance criteria:
  Numeric value text has visible inset from its left border in both themes; typed values,
  bounds, steps and +/- glyphs are preserved. All relevant numeric controls use the same inset.
  Current operational options/actions are accounted for by actual bindings. Mode-inapplicable
  controls are labelled, not presented as effective Video knobs. No claim of universal GUI
  coverage for developer utilities, future features or unsupported hardware.
  Preserve the approved card footer, diagnostic rail, clean-output recovery and minimal README.
  No new font/layout redesign, camera, portrait or remote publication.

